      "name": "RK_1214",
      "created_at": "2025-07-29T06:28:10.734Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I change the user language in ERPNext, only the standard DocTypes and fields are translated. But my custom DocTypes and custom fields are not translated. I need help to make custom DocTypes and custom fields change language too.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rk_1214/{size}/58141_2.png",
