      "username": "M.Toseef",
      "name": "Muhammad Toseef",
      "created_at": "2025-07-30T04:11:28.915Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For <strong>dynamic or field translations</strong>, go to your custom doctype → customze → select field, then check <strong>“translatable”</strong> checkbox form the field properties.</p>\n<p>For <strong>statci or string translations</strong>, go to <strong>“Translation”</strong> doctype and set the translations as you need.</p>\n<p>Also, <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/guides/basics/translations\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Translations</a></p>",
